==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nn|setje}}
* {{nn-inf|sett}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{m|non|setja}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nn}} {{m|gem-pro|*satjaną}}. Akin to {{cog|en|set}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/²sɛçːɑ/|lang=no}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-comireg}}

# to {{l|en|put}}, {{l|en|position}}
#: ''Eg '''set''' stolen her.''
#:: I'll '''put''' the chair here.

